<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_6675980c-1064-4321-85f0-28eb70ffe249"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_cfc3b792-8e58-45d4-9868-e823cc525a80"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_4ee343e9-61c9-49b3-b1fa-8c6688077357"
id="sec.4-def.function"><b><i>function</i></b></defterm> includes a power,
authority or duty, and <defterm type="definition"
guid="_dfabfd54-9ad9-4e96-9e42-e8a95ce0b24f"
id="sec.4-def.exercise"><b><i>exercise</i></b></defterm> a function includes
perform a duty.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_2800a9dd-f202-4c7e-b1aa-8c7a9861d932"
id="sec.4-def.governmentagency"><b><i>government agency</i></b></defterm>
means:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_ea64eaa5-6f57-40d4-8c25-abd0a40d18e7" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a public authority constituted by or under an
Act, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_fc3f2413-0a38-4a9f-b0db-a928c028fa7f" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a NSW Government agency, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f58fe377-0415-40b4-94a5-0a97ed3efa86" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a Division of the Government Service,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_98f47e71-60d2-4a58-b227-19b59847f5fc" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a local council or other local authority,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_ce95ad26-bc1a-4dd1-9cf6-51896ae8e2ab" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.e">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a State owned
corporation.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_7f83abec-6894-4c49-94ec-1ea73e8ea321"
id="sec.4-def.InfrastructureNSW"><b><i>Infrastructure NSW</i></b></defterm>
means Infrastructure NSW constituted under the <legref refid="act-2011-023"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Infrastructure
NSW Act 2011</i></name></legref>.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_39c22054-e59c-4572-8c5a-73068f0d0fc9"
id="sec.4-def.majorinfrastructureproject"><b><i>major infrastructure
project</i></b></defterm> has the same meaning as it has in the <legref
refid="act-2011-023" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Infrastructure NSW Act 2011</i></name></legref>.</txt>
<note type="legtext" guid="_14f88226-1588-4ea1-ab56-1a2915d42eeb"
id="sec.4-ssec.1-note"><heading guid="_56a27b9a-f3a8-4cd3-be66-935d1dc18c08"
id="sec.4-ssec.1-note-he"><b>Note&#8212;</b></heading>
<block><txt break.before="1">The expression is defined in that Act to mean a
project to provide infrastructure:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_6fef84fc-9dbe-4d84-8a35-62d87fc5dfda" id="sec.4-ssec.1-note-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">that has a capital investment value of more than
$100 million, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_6d6b3424-892f-4563-a942-2973a04f9f2f" id="sec.4-ssec.1-note-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">that is nominated by the Premier as a special
project requiring oversight or co-ordination by Infrastructure
NSW.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></note>
</block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_ddc4e416-53b4-4482-89c6-eb21ea10ea9c" id="sec.4-def.theFund"><b><i>the
Fund</i></b></defterm> means the Restart NSW Fund established under Part
2.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2fa1e19f-eb90-4882-8f5d-e1c389231dcf"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Notes included in this Act do not form part of
this Act.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d8dca36b-6858-4fbe-80dc-92ad17cf2e67"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 2</b></no><heading guid="_d822b613-4169-457b-aecf-5426df5aa8b9"
id="pt.2-he"><b>Restart NSW Fund</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_26257082-cb07-4e5b-a828-125ed510947f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_fd831445-499a-495e-a675-affca6be3285"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Establishment of Restart NSW Fund</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">There is to be established in the Special
Deposits Account a fund called the Restart NSW Fund.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5404d5f5-674c-4cc6-8a84-0d7c28956a45"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_f400f8ec-e52a-4c9b-9429-e7d3bf1f955f"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Purpose of Restart NSW Fund</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_7bcdd6c8-0d75-45c0-ac43-55d2f439a407"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The purpose of the Fund is to improve economic
growth and productivity in the State, and for that purpose:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b9b9c69b-0b37-48c7-8e7c-5e11c0837acd" id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to fund major infrastructure projects,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_eb9698a7-b990-453a-b167-567298bd685b" id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to fund infrastructure projects that will
improve:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_70896dbb-8feb-4540-b50a-d7b39511b522"
id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.b-para2.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">public transport, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f8c11212-22b5-40ff-8091-16a82c9b7c6c"
id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.b-para2.ii">
<no>(ii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">roads, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b432d824-64b8-4510-b006-e8eb64938daf"
id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.b-para2.iii">
<no>(iii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">infrastructure required for the economic
competitiveness of the State (including the movement of freight, inter-modal
facilities and access to water), and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_e0e775ce-04e2-45fd-8474-58c729356f59"
id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.b-para2.iv">
<no>(iv)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">local infrastructure in regional areas that are
affected by mining operations, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_a1b1a371-07e6-453b-9549-49dca5ce4e8b"
id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.b-para2.v">
<no>(v)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">hospital and other health facilities and
services, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_2250ffe3-f220-4a32-a25a-bbec13f02bbf"
id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.b-para2.vi">
<no>(vi)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">workplaces for law and justice officers,
teachers, nurses and other staff providing services to the
public.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5b30778c-fc95-450a-a57a-f38ba6338b29"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this section, a reference to <defterm
type="definition" guid="_9b6670b2-735f-4ee8-a54a-c73f24db9437"
id="sec.6-def.fundingaproject"><b><i>funding a project</i></b></defterm>
includes a reference to funding the planning, selection, implementation and
delivery of the project.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c069c0df-a5f4-48da-8bae-b5ca0b5236e5"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_3093f469-2f95-40b0-98e1-fcb7c2e59bc9"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Payments into Restart NSW Fund</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b2a7347e-089d-4dd6-82a6-0e3b3fb5f9e9"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">There is payable into the Fund:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f5a90c48-e774-42d6-847a-c7e8cc25c741" id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">all money advanced by the Treasurer or
appropriated by Parliament for the purposes of the Fund, including any such
money that is certified by the Treasurer as windfall tax revenue in excess of
Budget forecasts, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d4fb5d8d-1163-486f-843b-30bc65d623f0" id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">money borrowed for the purposes of the Fund,
including by the issue of special bonds to the people of the State and others,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_769b2a4b-698f-415d-a8da-99d52a89952b" id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the proceeds of the investment of money in the
Fund, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_166330cb-8695-4fa7-b490-f5ebec740129" id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">all money directed or authorised to be paid into
the Fund by or under this or any other Act or law, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_fd3bf472-cc9c-4909-9f33-cdd32ca977a4" id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.e">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">all money received from voluntary contributions
to the Fund made by a government agency or other person or
body.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c621bd8e-14df-4be4-8f42-c83eb41b3c24"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Government agencies are authorised by this
section to make voluntary contributions to the Fund.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_00a557a8-a2d3-44ad-89e9-db199fb04a54"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading guid="_92546950-9096-4760-809b-cb1a0c6d8845"
id="sec.8-he"><b>Payments out of Restart NSW Fund</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">There is payable from the Fund:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_1ebafe56-92a9-4192-a822-c892b3d2a838" id="sec.8-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any money approved by the Minister on the
recommendation of Infrastructure NSW to fund all or any part of the cost of
any project that the Minister is satisfied promotes a purpose of the Fund,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_3e112531-3a8d-4ebe-93ea-9d1e50682409" id="sec.8-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any money required to meet administrative
expenses related to the Fund, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_e3ea6c53-1868-495c-b88f-0b2c6244d3a5" id="sec.8-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any money directed or authorised to be paid from
the Fund by or under this or any other Act or law.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.9">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8c84984b-1513-46d2-8206-e35517c7ef50"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>9</no><heading guid="_7d32602a-fc0f-475b-aaad-356f4b61b008"
id="sec.9-he"><b>Annual and other reports relating to Restart NSW
Fund</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_7c95d0b2-ebc9-4ba4-85e1-c853c57cd981"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister is to produce an annual report
detailing payments from the Fund.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_63abf26e-de8f-408f-bd55-ce533f9f3837"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The annual report is to include information on
the total amount of payments made from the Fund for infrastructure projects in
rural and regional areas outside the metropolitan areas of Sydney, Newcastle
and Wollongong, and whether it represents at least 30% of the total payments
from the Fund on infrastructure projects.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_9a6cafd4-0675-4597-bb3b-e2dee97b2279"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The annual report is to include the audit of the
Fund by the Auditor General (including the report of the Auditor General on
whether the payments from the Fund have been made in accordance with this
Act).</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c3aef908-fb2c-4bf6-a92c-b8aa7b04af14"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The annual report is to be tabled in each House
of Parliament within 6 months after the end of the financial year to which it
relates.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b6f4679a-891e-4eb2-927a-38b1f4ad8861"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(5)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister is also to ensure that
Infrastructure NSW receives regular reports on the balance of money standing
to the credit of the Fund.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.10">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_da491089-c6da-4118-8d01-a8be4cb19742"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>10</no><heading guid="_60fa3934-61ed-4298-978e-1b972dd26c50"
id="sec.10-he"><b>Investment of money in Restart NSW
Fund</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister may invest money in the Fund:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_0a735c65-82df-4ace-872f-440d57840e28" id="sec.10-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">if the Minister is a GSF agency for the purposes
of Part 6 of the <legref refid="act-2018-055" jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Government Sector Finance Act
2018</i></name></legref>&#8212;in any way that the Minister is permitted to
invest money under that Part, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_4d20a95e-e033-47f7-a6cd-50ce77ae2cd4" id="sec.10-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">if the Minister is not a GSF agency for the
purposes of Part 6 of the <legref refid="act-2018-055" jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Government Sector Finance Act
2018</i></name></legref>&#8212;in any way approved by the
Treasurer.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>

<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 10:</b> Subst 2018 No
70, Sch 3.53.</txt></content>
</level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_39732832-9325-424d-82bb-f791fdd2729d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 3</b></no><heading guid="_6bfd1f55-0411-4513-bd40-a4fba1b835d2"
id="pt.3-he"><b>Miscellaneous</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.11">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_08ee278b-07c9-409b-8dfb-46f84675c434"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>11</no><heading guid="_4277fdde-1a81-4c4f-95c0-64506c0a5079"
id="sec.11-he"><b>Act to bind Crown</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act binds the Crown in right of New South
Wales and, in so far as the legislative power of the Parliament of New South
Wales permits, the Crown in all its other capacities.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.12">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_63ad2615-0b42-4924-b31a-25187b6c9ca1"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.12"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>12</no><heading guid="_5cec928d-3b41-482b-a80b-0838250157e3"
id="sec.12-he"><b>Regulations</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.12-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a0c974ec-4470-4cde-9349-b524b907d8fd"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.12-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may make regulations, not
inconsistent with this Act, for or with respect to any matter that by this Act
is required or permitted to be prescribed or that is necessary or convenient
to be prescribed for carrying out or giving effect to this
Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.12-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d68abeaf-ca2c-4062-af1e-a35097b45c3b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.12-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The regulations may contain provisions of a
savings or transitional nature consequent on the enactment of this
Act.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.13">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_22672a77-25f9-4826-9c0d-ad70e4233bb3"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>13</no><heading guid="_c99b808a-b85c-40ea-9567-4137fffe61ad"
id="sec.13-he"><b>Review of Act</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.13-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_80ac53f7-d892-4142-a91c-5c30884ab53b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister is to review this Act to determine
whether the policy objectives of the Act remain valid and whether the terms of
the Act remain appropriate for securing those
objectives.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.13-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_75f83282-9613-449e-90fa-6043a52e2c0b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The review is to be undertaken as soon as
possible after the period of 5 years from the commencement of this
Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.13-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_659a5465-1188-46da-afd9-41e654a6dcc5"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A report on the outcome of the review is to be
tabled in each House of Parliament within 12 months after the end of the
period of 5 years.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</level>
</content>


